  "title": "Toyota Motor North America Reports June, Second Quarter 2026 U.S. Sales Results",
  "summary": "PLANO, Texas (July 1, 2026) – Toyota Motor North America (TMNA) today reported June 2026 U.S. sales of 212,793 vehicles, up 10.1 percent on a volume basis and up 5.7 percent on a daily selling rate (DSR) basis compared to June 2025. Sales of electrified vehicles for the month totaled 122,063, up 35.0 percent on a volume basis and up 29.6 percent on a DSR basis, representing 57.4 percent of total sales volume.",
